            "category": "state",
            "description": "Hovering an inactive primary tab painted a 2px currentColor underline (#121212). The SCSS hover rule assigned the border shorthand custom property --tab-border-bottom to the border-bottom-color longhand, which is invalid at computed-value time and falls back to currentcolor. Fixed by using the border-bottom shorthand; recaptured as 2px transparent."
          }
        ]
